    "description": "Single-cell tumor phylogeny inference with copy-number constrained mutation losses.\n\nSCARLET (Single-cell Algorithm for Reconstructing Loss-supported Evolution of Tumors) is an algorithm that reconstructs tumor phylogenies from single-cell DNA sequencing data. SCARLET uses a loss-supported model that constrains mutation losses based on observed copy-number data.",
